The kmi directory layout is:

kmi
|-- README
|-- aarch64
|   |-- abi.stg
|   |-- abi.stg.approved_breaks
|   |-- protected_exports
|   |-- protected_modules
|   |-- defconfig
|   |   |-- allmodconfig
|   |   |-- fragment1
|   |   `-- ...
|   `-- symbols
|       |-- base
|       |-- vendor1
|       `-- ...
`-- ...

Vendors will maintain kmi/$arch/symbols/$vendor and update
kmi/$arch/abi.stg.
